I was stunned by the amount of work done for this "exercising" of stats.
Almost everything you do and everything that happens to you has an effect
on your stats going up or down.  For you unix people, do a grep on the
source directory for the word "exercise".

The following is a fairly accurate list of the events that cause a stat to
be exercised.  Each stat is abbreviated, with a + or - preceding it to
indicate whether the event is a positive or negative exercising of that
attribute.

Here we go:

----------------------------------------------------------------------
There is no exercising of int or cha
There is no physical exercising while polymorphed

Regular hunger check (every 10 moves)
satiated: 		-dex
not hungry:		+con
weak:			-str
faint(ing/ed):		-con

Regular encumber check (every 10 moves)
moderate:		+str
heavy:			+str -dex
extreme:		-dex -con

Other regular checks (every 5 moves)
if clairvoyant		+wis
regenerating		+str
sick or vomiting	-con
confused or halluc.	-wis
wounded legs/fumb/stun	-dex


As result of your actions or things that happen to you:

-str		hit, dragged down stairs by iron ball
+wis		detecting gold, food
+wis		magic mapping level
+wis		finding secret doors, hidden/invisible monsters, trap
+dex		good kick
-dex		bad kick
+wis		kicked sink and found ring
-str		kicked wall (Ouch!  That hurts!), strained muscle
-str		exploding door
+str		shattered door or kicked it open
+dex		caught boomerang, hit monster by throwing
+str		threw heavy ball, boulder
+wis		engraved Elbereth
-str		being burnt
+wis		good things from fountain (knowledge, Excalibur, gems..)
-wis		bad things from fountain (cursed item, lost gold..)
-con		quaffed bad water
+wis		found ring in sink
+str		pushed heavy object (boulder)
-dex		bump into door
+dex		attempted to pick lock (succeeded or failed)
+str or +dex	tried to force lock, failed
-dex		broke weapon while forcing lock
+str or +dex	successfully forced lock
+str		pulled at door that resisted
-str		being crushed or choked
-wis		mind attack succeeded
-dex		you are frozen!
-dex -str	wounded legs
+dex		charmed/calmed something with music
-wis		woke things up with load "music"
+wis		tried to open drawbridge with instrument
+wis		sacrificing on altar
+wis		read scroll
+/-wis		read true/false rumor
+wis		study spellbook
-str		hit by falling rock
+dex		hit monster
+wis		writing scroll/spellbook
+/-dex		you speed up/slow down
+wis		use scroll/spell/wand

(Some reasonably obvious things have been left out)
